  "Inverted avoir, an adverb, the participle (As-tu déjà mangé ?)."

rule v.proclitic-inverted-perfect-avoir: V[dperson=?dp, dnum=?dn, lemma=?l, finite=yes, form=fin, mood=?m, person=?p, number=?n, subj=yes, acc=yes, neg=no, gender=?g, anum=?on, agen=?og, aperson=?ap, agreed=yes, aux_mood=?m, aux_tense=?auxt, aux_person=?r, aux_number=?n, aux_form=?auxf] -> Clitics[dperson=?dp, dnum=?dn, attached=no, reflexive=no, acc=yes, anum=?on, agen=?og, aperson=?ap, refl=?r, obj=?o, rnum=?n] Verb[lemma=avoir, finite=yes, mood=?m, person=?p, number=?n, person=?r, person!=?o, tense=?auxt, form=?auxf] Pron[attached=yes, case=nom, person=?p, number=?n, gender=?g] Verb[lemma=?l, form=pastpart, takes_avoir=yes, number=?on, gender=?og]
